{"parse": {"title": "虚无的倒影-06", "pageid": 106600, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%99%9A%E6%97%A0%E7%9A%84%E5%80%92%E5%BD%B1-05\" title=\"虚无的倒影-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">虚无的倒影-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%99%9A%E6%97%A0%E7%9A%84%E5%80%92%E5%BD%B1-07\" title=\"虚无的倒影-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">虚无的倒影</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.85.89.E8.BE.89.E4.B9.8B.E9.97.A8\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"光辉之门\">光辉之门</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 光辉之门</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Passage to the Light</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_at_men2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_at_men2\"><img alt=\"2_8_at_men2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/Cg-2_8_at_men2.png/600px-Cg-2_8_at_men2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/Cg-2_8_at_men2.png/900px-Cg-2_8_at_men2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/Cg-2_8_at_men2.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_at_men2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>……他们最后都死了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>只留下我一个人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>啊……我也走到了这里，和我的朋友一起，可惜我们没有走到终点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灵体Ⅰ：</div><div>诺谛卡，为什么他们的死是充满遗憾的呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它的发问充满疑惑，因而显得纯真。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>他们没有抵达终点，在道路的中间迷失了……这不是他们想要的结局。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>我也一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527602.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-527602.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527602.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527602.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-527602.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527602.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-527602.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527602.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灵体Ⅱ：</div><div>可怜的诺谛卡，你的生命如此短暂，所以你才这样懵懂呀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灵体Ⅲ：</div><div>诺谛卡，正因为我们的生命短暂，所以我们从来不是一个人去走完正确的道路……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在这最深的黑暗，这些灵魂以自身的光芒开始灼烧这个巨大的、蠕动的胃部。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灵体Ⅰ：</div><div>你已获得了启示，又习得了智慧，继承了他们的无畏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527602.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-527602.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527602.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527602.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-527602.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527602.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-527602.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527602.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灵体Ⅱ：</div><div>诺谛卡，从起点开始，我们已经走过很远的道路了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灵体Ⅲ：</div><div>从这里开始……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灵体Ⅰ：</div><div>离开这里吧，你已经是最勇敢的人。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一扇光辉的大门打开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>它……它通往终点吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的目光已经投向那里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>正如地母的传说故事之中，所有穷途末路的子民，都会在最后为她的光芒所拂照。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们会看见家乡，然后迎接希望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312015.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-312015.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312015.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312015.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-312015.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312015.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-312015.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312015.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>地母……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-woshi_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"woshi_ye\"><img alt=\"woshi_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/600px-Cg-woshi_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/900px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/1200px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗夫：</div><div>我一直有预感……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗夫：</div><div>这一次南极之旅，我一定会目睹她的光辉，诺谛卡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗夫：</div><div>因为人世的纷扰未曾使我动摇，我的孩子，是你让我更加坚信这一点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗夫：</div><div>有地母的保佑，我们一定走在正确的道路上。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_at_zufu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_at_zufu\"><img alt=\"2_8_at_zufu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/Cg-2_8_at_zufu.png/600px-Cg-2_8_at_zufu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/Cg-2_8_at_zufu.png/900px-Cg-2_8_at_zufu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/Cg-2_8_at_zufu.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_at_zufu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-524712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-524712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-524712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗夫：</div><div>诺谛卡……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-524712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-524712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-524712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗夫：</div><div>那里的一切……啊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-524712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-524712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-524712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗夫：</div><div>一场空谈……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>祖父……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>可是祖父的预感没有实现，他曾以为他会走进一扇光辉的门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这样的回忆也让她踌躇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>失去了身体，意识只要能够下定决心，抉择几乎不费力气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可是一小缕薄弱的意识，一阵风便可把它吹散，懦弱地留在家乡的幻象之中，不去继续走最正确的路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>我要想一想……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灵体Ⅰ：</div><div>是的，智者无论何时都会思考。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527602.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-527602.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527602.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527602.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-527602.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527602.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-527602.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527602.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灵体Ⅱ：</div><div>我们在这里等你，诺谛卡……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一小缕意识离开了，它难以坚定，踌躇不前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她行走在家乡的幻境之中，走在她第一次探险的道路上，她记得那是一场无疾而终的冒险。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她也记得……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-527701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-527701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-527701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小鹿：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312014.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-312014.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312014.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312014.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-312014.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312014.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-312014.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312014.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>啊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她一出声，便惊动了这只正在水洼中啜饮的动物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它机警地与诺谛卡对视，转身离开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312014.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-312014.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312014.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312014.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-312014.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312014.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-312014.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312014.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>等……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-312010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-312010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-312010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>等一下！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一小缕意识飘飘忽忽地追了上去。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-senlin.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"senlin\"><img alt=\"senlin\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-senlin.png/600px-Cg-senlin.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-senlin.png/900px-Cg-senlin.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-senlin.png/1200px-Cg-senlin.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-312010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-312010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-312010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>等等我……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>家乡的幻境如此真实，仿佛让人又回到撒开腿奔跑的童年。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>呼……呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-527701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-527701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-527701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小鹿：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>这个是……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一座墓碑，静静伫立在树下，有风拂来，绑在树枝上的编织布条轻轻抚摸她的发顶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>埋葬在树下的是生命，亲手制作的织物则代表悼念，是家乡送别的礼仪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她很熟悉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312015.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-312015.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312015.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312015.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-312015.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312015.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-312015.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312015.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>这是谁的墓碑？我想不起来了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>……黛格妮是谁？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>稚嫩的手法凿刻出一个名字，苔痕已爬上墓碑的底部，它的生命旅程和逝去的时间都不算漫长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312026.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-312026.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312026.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312026.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-312026.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312026.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-312026.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312026.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>无论你是谁，请安息吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-527701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-527701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-527701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小鹿：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一小缕即将消散的意识，跟随着一头陌生的小鹿，行走在记忆中的家乡之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当寒冷的空气接触到温暖的大地，在森林里，几乎每个清晨都会起雾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>前方的道路逐渐被雾气笼罩，无法辨明方向，更找不到出口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灵体Ⅰ：</div><div>诺谛卡……诺谛卡……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527602.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-527602.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527602.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527602.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-527602.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527602.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-527602.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527602.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灵体Ⅱ：</div><div>你迷路了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>光辉的灵魂遥遥地呼唤她的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>应该会有别的出口的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小鹿停驻在河边，两双眼睛一同朝河对岸望去——除了浓重的雾气，那里什么也没有了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-527701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-527701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-527701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小鹿：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>要过去吗？这里的水看上去很深……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灵体Ⅲ：</div><div>你走得太远了……诺谛卡……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>深不见底的河流阻拦了她们的去路，鹿的掌蹄摩擦着湿润的岸堤，不安地踌躇着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-527601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灵体Ⅰ：</div><div>在你迷失之前，请回来吧，诺谛卡。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "虚无的倒影-06"}}